title: EEE202 Project Evaluator
message: >-
  If you use this tool, please cite it using the metadata
  in this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: İsmail Can
    family-names: Dikmen
    email: can.dikmen@istinye.edu.tr
    affiliation: Istinye University, Department of Electrical and Electronics Engineering
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7747-7777'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/DrCanD/eee202-project-evaluator'
abstract: >-
  Automated grading tool for student PDF submissions in
  EEE202 Signals and Systems courses. Scores submissions
  on a 100-point scale across five rubric sections,
  detects template contamination, extracts student
  identity from PDF content, and renames files to a
  canonical format for instructor convenience.
keywords:
  - signals and systems
  - automated grading
  - rubric
  - higher education
  - PDF processing
  - educational technology
